<h2 id="ha-ctrl-005-acceptance">Acceptance and evidence</h2>

1. Check Heat with Idle, Heat with Heating, Off, unknown and unavailable separately. A mode change must not change the measured temperature.
2. Try decimal steps, Celsius and Fahrenheit, single and dual targets, an invalid order, and a mode removed during editing.
3. Test a fan without oscillation, a dehumidifier with no current humidity and a water heater with no reported temperature. Show no invented controls and no zeroes.
4. Reject one target request and delay another beyond the waiting limit. Keep native safety and code flows, keyboard access, source precision and meaningful pending text.

Record what was tested using [Native task accessibility and evidence](native-task-accessibility.html). A source review or a local example is not a live-device check.

